# README.md
# Fuzzy Wine Quality Prediction System

A fuzzy logic-based system for predicting wine quality based on chemical properties.

## Overview

This project implements a fuzzy inference system (FIS) to predict wine quality scores (0-10) based on 10 chemical properties of wine. The system uses scikit-fuzzy to define membership functions and rules that mimic expert knowledge in wine evaluation.

## Features

- Interactive prediction mode for single wine samples
- Batch prediction mode for entire datasets
- 15 fuzzy rules based on wine chemistry knowledge
- Membership functions for all chemical properties
- Quality ratings: Very Poor, Poor, Average, Good, Excellent

